1T23:14:16Z"},"body":"Another follow-up to #111469 (is there anything left from the original code? 🤔)\r\n\r\nCopying section/category values had a major flaw cause by how the properties were copied. The inspector relied on Object's `get_property_list()`, which could return list that does not exactly match what is displayed in the inspector (due to various special cases). The code to extract properties belonging to sections/categories was a bit hacky and reliable.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes it to happen completely on the inspector side. The properties will now register themselves in the parent section/category, so when copying values, they are copied from the list of EditorProperties, instead of object's properties. They are pasted into the EditorProperties too. This allowed to simplify the code (no more special cases for MultiNodeEdit etc.).\r\n\r\n- Fixes #116889\r\n- Fixes the above bug for shader parameters (idk if there is open issue)\r\n- Fixes being able to paste section values into read-only properties\r\n- Fixes errors and resetting values when property name is not in clipboard (regression from #117600)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events",